# Linked questions (Boss, 2026-10-29): the same decision came to him as two cards, from Phone A and from the MacBook
# thread t1703ae4f; he answered one and the other kept waiting. Fictional fixture: Phone A and a Mac thread "Skills
# cleanup" ask "Restore the 3 deleted skills or leave them deleted?". No agent, runner or Mac is reached.
# touchVouches: the walk's taps count as his finger, as a real one does in Soma.
# 1. Linked (Phone A's question names t1703ae4f): answering it answers the Mac thread's too, as his.
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion linked --ez touchVouches true
clearlog
expect Questions waiting
expect Same question waiting in Skills cleanup (linked)
shot linked-question-card-cover
tap answer questions
expect Restore the 3 deleted skills or leave them deleted?
tap Leave deleted
log fixture phone answered
log fixture mac answered
shot linked-question-answered-cover
# On the Oma tab, where the Mac thread's card was: nothing waits any more.
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es waitingQuestion linked --es startTab oma --ez touchVouches true
wait 1500
absent Questions waiting
absent Restore the 3 deleted skills
shot linked-question-mac-cleared-cover
